eed data display\n- Ability to handle large data sets\n- Curve-fitting, Fourier transforms, smoothing, statistics, and other data analysis\n- Waveform arithmetic\n- Image display and processing\n- Combination graphical and command-line user interface\n- Automation and data processing via a built-in programming environment\n- Extensibility through modules written in the C and C++ languages\nSome people use Igor simply to produce high-quality, finely-tuned scientific graphics. Others use Igor as an all-purpose workhorse to acquire, analyze and present experimental data using its built-in programming environment.","name":"Igor Pro 8","packageUrl":"https://www.wavemetrics.com/downloads/current","publisher":"WaveMetrics","publisherUrl":"https://www.wavemetrics.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.wavemetrics.com/news/igor-pro-804-released","tags":["diagram","graph","graphics","plot"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"科学家和工程师的技术绘图与数据分析软件","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Igor Pro 是一款集数据可视化、分析、转换与呈现于一体的综合性实验数据处理软件。\nIgor Pro 核心功能包括：\n- 可发表级科研绘图\n- 高速数据展示\n- 海量数据集处理能力\n- 曲线拟合、傅里叶变换、数据平滑、统计分析等数据处理功能\n- 波形运算\n- 图像显示与处理\n- 图形化界面与命令行双操作模式\n- 通过内置编程环境实现自动化数据处理\n- 支持 C/C++ 语言编写扩展模块\n用户群体主要分为两类：科研人员既可用其制作精调细校的高质量科学图表，也可通过内置编程环境将其作为全功能工作平台，完成从数据采集、分析到成果展示的全流程工作。","tags":["图形","图示","图表","绘图"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.wavemetrics.com/","releaseDate":"2019-11-19","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.wavemetrics.com/news/igor-pro-804-released","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/w/WaveMetrics/IgorPro/8/8.0.4.2/WaveMetrics.IgorPro.8.yaml","sha256":"4c030b424932372fe07e2868d04d901efd8d0e44902e67475de49d74a801b727"},{"path":"manifests/w/WaveMetrics/IgorPro/8/8.0.4.2/WaveMetrics.IgorPro.8.installer.yaml","sha256":"0b79c700c688a2256d33732bbe4434faa1fe2a2a1a733db15c8e6cd44b40b027"},{"path":"manifests/w/WaveMetrics/IgorPro/8/8.0.4.